# git common subcommands and options
sub status       Show working tree status
sub diff         Show changes between commits or tree
sub log          Show commit logs
sub add          Add file contents to the index
sub commit       Record changes to the repository
sub branch       List, create, or delete branches
sub checkout     Switch branches or restore files
sub switch       Switch branches
sub restore      Restore working tree files
sub pull         Fetch and integrate from remote
sub push         Update remote refs
sub fetch        Download objects from remote
sub merge        Join development histories
sub rebase       Reapply commits on another base
sub show         Show objects and commits
sub stash        Stash local changes
opt --version    Print git version
opt --help       Show git help
opt -C           Run as if git was started in path
